---
import { siteConfig } from "../lib/config";
---

<section id="about" class="section bg-[var(--color-bg-alt)]">
  <div class="container-main">
    <p class="section-label">Position</p>

    <h2 class="max-w-4xl font-display text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
      {siteConfig.bio}
    </h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 md:gap-12 mt-16">
      {siteConfig.stats.map((stat) => (
        <div class="stat-item">
          <p class="stat-number text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.5rem)] text-gradient">
            {stat.value}
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] tracking-wide uppercase">
            {stat.label}
          </p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="principle-card rounded-[8px] border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[rgba(242,232,213,0.025)] p-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--color-accent)]">01 / Leak</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold">先找漏点</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">客户、线索、跟进、复盘，哪一环最散，AI 就先从哪一环进入。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card rounded-[8px] border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[rgba(242,232,213,0.025)] p-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--color-accent)]">02 / Table</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold">先留结构</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">第一张基础表，比第一个智能体更重要。没有结构，自动化只会加速混乱。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card rounded-[8px] border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[rgba(242,232,213,0.025)] p-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--color-accent)]">03 / System</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold">再选工具</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Agent、workflow、Codex 都不是信仰。它们只是不同业务动作的执行器。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
